foundation.question_text:
The circumference of this circle is $22$ cm. Find its diameter, correct to the nearest centimetre.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.9]
\coordinate (O) at (0,0);
\draw (0,0) circle (2.1);
\fill (O) circle (1.8pt);
\draw (205:2.1) -- (25:2.1);
\node[above left] at (25:0.55) {$d$};
\node at (0,2.75) {$C = 22\text{ cm}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

